  "description": "Variation of Condition 2 (Drawings) Condition 5 (Windows) and Condition 7 (Construction Logistics Plan) following planning permission 01177/12/P16 dated 13/08/2021 for the erection of a basement floor with two front lightwells. Demolition of existing part ground floor and first floor rear extensions and erection of full length single storey rear and part first floor rear extensions. One rooflight to the side roof elevation",
  "site_name": null,
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "31/08/2022",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "W4 4BL",
  "street_name": "Wellesley Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "lapsed_date": "11/09/2025",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (Site location Plan, Approved Ground Floor Plan (ref: 1148-02-03 A), Approved First Floor Plan (ref: 1148-02-04 A), Approved Section BB (ref: 1148-02-08 A), Approved West Side Elevation (ref: 1148-02-09.1 A), Approved Rear Elevation (ref: 1148-02-11 A), Proposed Ground Floor Plan (ref: 299_30_10), Proposed First Floor Plan (ref: 299_30_11), Proposed Section 20 (ref: 299_30_20), Proposed West Side Elevation (ref: 299_30_32), Proposed Rear Elevation (ref: 299_30_31), Supplementary Construction Management Plan for Phase 1 Works) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am  to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9 :00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - No additional windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the  side walls of the extension hereby approved and no additional doors inserted in the building without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.\r\n",
    "Condition : 6 - The roof lights shall be 'conservation style', installed to be flush with the existing roof slope.",
    "Condition : 7 - No excavation or construction work associated with the approved basement shall be undertaken prior to the submission and approval in writing by the Local Planning Authority of a mini Construction Logistics Plan which will include delivery timings, suspension of bays and temporary licence if material storage is required on the public Highway.",
    "Condition : 8 - The basement shall at no time be used or occupied as a separate dwelling independent of the main house and shall not be used as sleeping accommodation.",
    "Condition : 9 - No development shall be carried out until such time as the person carrying out the work is a member of the Considerate Constructors Scheme and its code of practice, and the details of the membership and contact details are clearly displayed on the site so that they can be easily read by members of the public."
  ],
